## Usage Examples

To use the `FileExplorer` component, simply import it and include it in your JSX, passing an `onSelectFile` function as a prop to handle file selection events.

```javascript
import React from 'react';
import FileExplorer from './components/FileExplorer';

const App = () => {
    const handleFileSelection = (path, name) => {
        console.log(`Selected file: ${name} at path: ${path}`);
    };

    return (
        <div className="App">
            <FileExplorer onSelectFile={handleFileSelection} />
        </div>
    );
};

export default App;

```

